BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-76538\n\nMonday 24 and Tuesday 25 August\nNightly from 7:30PM to 2AM\, buses replace trains between Lithgow and Penrith.\nThe last trains to run between Blue Mountains Line stations and Central leave:\n- Mount Victoria at 18:56\, arriving Central at 21:17\n- Central at 18:26\, arriving Lithgow at 21:15\nT1 Western Line trains run between Penrith and Central.\nTuesday and Wednesday\, the 02:26 Mount Victoria to Central service leaves Mount Victoria at 02:41 and runs up to 15 minutes later than the normal timetable.
DTEND:20260825T160000Z
DTSTART:20260825T093000Z
SUMMARY:Buses replace trains between Lithgow and Penrith
